---
title: "cancel (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: cancel()
    q_check_auth --> q_check_not_published: caller is projectAdmin
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_check_not_published --> q_check_not_canceled: resultsPublished == false
    q_check_not_published --> q_revert_published: results already published
    q_check_not_canceled --> q_set_canceled: isCanceled == false
    q_check_not_canceled --> q_revert_canceled: already canceled
    q_set_canceled --> q_emit: isCanceled = true
    q_emit --> [*]: emit SaleCancelled(timestamp)
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert UnauthorizedAccess
    q_revert_published --> [*]: revert ResultsAlreadyPublished
    q_revert_canceled --> [*]: revert AlreadyCanceled

    note right of q_set_canceled
        INV-001: cancel only allowed before results publication
        INV-002: isCanceled is monotonic false->true
        INV-003: after cancellation, invest() reverts, withdrawInvestedCapitalIfCanceled() enabled
    end note
